# Credentials and local configuration; retain blank documentation examples.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# Local dependencies, diagnostics and one-shot live probe.
node_modules/
coverage/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
runtime/live-once.mjs
runtime/.live-api-attempted
# Its guard tests go with it: they execute the script as a child process and
# read its source, so publishing them without it would ship a broken suite.
runtime/tests/live-once.test.mjs

# Internal reports. They carry the defect diagnosis, the correction
# priorities and the publication arbitration; the public register of what
# does and does not work is KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md, which IS published.
runtime/REFERENCE_AND_LOOPBACK_REPORT.md
runtime/FINALISATION_REPORT.md
runtime/PUBLICATION_READINESS_REPORT.md

# Recorded API responses. Execution data, not source: they are produced by a
# capture run against a test instance and reviewed before being shared.
# tests/captured-rest.test.mjs skips, with a stated reason, when absent.
runtime/tests/fixtures/captured/
**/fixtures/captured/
*.captured.json
observation.json
report_*.json
